94
00:11:33,539 --> 00:11:41,480
In all those cases, you do not reproduce usually the material that you have burnt up.

95
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:47,220
You will always have to add in a little uranium,

96
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:52,539
a little mined uranium, a few percent.

97
00:11:53,759 --> 00:11:57,539
But for that much, we will always be able to pay.

98
00:11:58,739 --> 00:12:03,759
