and which can breed, which can give you, starting from the fuel,

102
00:12:23,479 --> 00:12:26,840
uranium-233, that you obtain from thorium,

103
00:12:27,239 --> 00:12:30,840
starting from that fuel, you get more than you started from.

104
00:12:30,940 --> 00:12:33,000
That is what is meant by breeding.

105
00:12:33,979 --> 00:12:38,040
