222
00:25:34,759 --> 00:25:39,580
for future nuclear energy so that it should last effectively forever.

223
00:25:40,859 --> 00:25:42,900
And then make the best choice.

224
00:25:43,619 --> 00:25:49,600
A very important part of that program is to build and build well

